 "text": "Government Offices | Dade County, Missouri\nOffices\nAssessor\nPublic GIS\nChange Of Address\nPersonal Property E-File\nProperty Assessment Appeal\nPersonal Property FAQs\nReal Estate FAQs\nCircuit Clerk\nJury Duty\nCourt Dates\nCourt Costs\nForms\nI Want To...\nContact Us\nCollector\nTax Questions\nPay Taxes Online\nMethods Of Payment\nMerchants License\nChange Of Address\nDelinquent Tax Sale\nCounty Clerk\nProsecuting Attorney\nProsecuting A Case\nI Want To...\nVictim Advocate Services\nRecorder Of Deeds\nJobs\nDirectory\nPay / Search Taxes Online\ne-Juror Registration\nPersonal Property E-File\nWelcome to Dade County.\nLocated in the heart of Southwest Missouri, Dade County is a peaceful place to live, work and retire. The elected officials and county staff are here to help the taxpayers of Dade County in a professional and courteous manner under the laws and regulations set forward by the State of Missouri. We have an open-door policy and are here to help answer any questions. It is our hope that this site will be a useful and informative resource for the citizens of our area.\nSearch the Directory\nDade County Courthouse, 300 W. Water St, Greenfield, MO 65661\nAccessibility Statement\n© 2026\nAll Rights Reserved | Dade County, MO\nShare by:",
